{"surah":94,"verses":{"1":{"phrases":[{"text":"Have We not uplifted your heart for you ˹O Prophet˺","ar":"","head":"","parts":[]}]},"2":{"phrases":[{"text":"relieved you of the burden","ar":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَنْكَ وِزْرَكَ","head":"","parts":[0]}]},"3":{"phrases":[{"text":"which weighed so heavily on your back","ar":"الَّذِي أَنْقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","head":"","parts":[0]}]},"4":{"phrases":[{"text":"and elevated your renown for you","ar":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","head":"","parts":[0]}]},"5":{"phrases":[{"text":"So, surely with hardship comes ease","ar":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","head":"","parts":[0,1]}]},"6":{"phrases":[{"text":"Surely with ˹that˺ hardship comes ˹more˺ ease","ar":"إِنَّ مَعَ الْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","head":"","parts":[0,1]}]},"7":{"phrases":[{"text":"So once you have fulfilled ˹your duty˺, strive ˹in devotion˺","ar":"","head":"","parts":[0,8]}]},"8":{"phrases":[{"text":"turning to your Lord ˹alone˺ with hope","ar":"","head":"","parts":[0]}]}}}